## 1. Executive Summary

A comprehensive architectural and functional audit of the **ShippNex** codebase was conducted across all four system user roles: **Customer (User)**, **Merchant (Seller)**, **Delivery Agent (Captain)**, and **Platform Operator (Admin)**.

The backend demonstrates a **solid, well-architected foundation**. Core e-commerce workflows, multi-seller split order pipelines, automated commission and wallet settlement ledgers, delivery driver dispatch with 4-digit OTP security, and role-based access control are already implemented and working.

The remaining **20%** consists primarily of third-party external integrations (live payment gateway webhooks, SMS providers), real-time bidirectional communication (WebSockets for live GPS and audio/visual order alerts), administrative analytics aggregations, and specialized post-purchase modules (returns/RTO, tax invoices, coupon engines).

